{"unit_id":"tag:03RW:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets），定义于<MATH_0002>上，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>可构造（constructible）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0003>，存在有限（finite）分解（decomposition），将<MATH_0004>分解为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant），对所有<MATH_0007>成立。\n<STRUCT_0003>层（sheaf），其值为阿贝尔群（abelian groups），定义于<MATH_0008>上，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>可构造（constructible）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0009>，存在有限（finite）分解（decomposition），将<MATH_0010>分解为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes）<MATH_0011>，使得<MATH_0012>有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant），对所有<MATH_0013>成立。\n<STRUCT_0004>设<MATH_0014>为 Noether 环（Noetherian ring）。层（sheaf），其值为<MATH_0015>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0016>上，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>可构造（constructible）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，若对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0017>，存在有限（finite）分解（decomposition），将<MATH_0018>分解为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes）<MATH_0019>，使得<MATH_0020>有限型（finite type）且局部常值（locally constant），对所有<MATH_0021>成立。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"constru