{"unit_id":"tag:05BE:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n看来这是公认的定义。另一种定义更容易推广到概形的平展位点之外，即先取平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）位点（site），对于概形（scheme）而言，并以\n<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>\n为起点来定义可构造层（constructible sheaves），其中<MATH_0004>遍历所有拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的对象（objects），属于<MATH_0005>，再取最小的满子范畴（full subcategory），属于<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>，包含这些对象并对有限极限（finite limits）及余极限（colimits）封闭。由引理<REF_0001>以及引理<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>可知，若<MATH_0009>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），这样得到的范畴（category）相同。但一般而言，这样得到的范畴（category）并不相同。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n不交并（disjoint union）分解（decomposition）<MATH_0010>，将概形（scheme）分解为局部闭子概形（closed subschemes），称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>划分（partition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对应于<MATH_0011>（与拓扑（Topology），第<REF_0005>节比较）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095E:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets），定义于<MATH_0003>上。以下条件等价（equivalent）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>可构造（constructible），\n<STRUCT_0003>存在开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>可构造（constructible），以及\n<STRUCT_0004>存在划分（partition）<MATH_0007>，其各项为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes），使得<MATH_0008>有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n类似断言对阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）和层（sheaves），其值为<MATH_0009>-模（modules），也成立，若<MATH_0010>为 Noether（Noetherian）的。\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"