{"unit_id":"tag:095E:proof","translation":"(1)蕴含(2)是清楚的。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设(2)。对每个<MATH_0001>，我们都能找到<MATH_0002>和仿射开集（affine open），作为邻域（neighbourhood），即<MATH_0003>，包含<MATH_0004>。因此可以找到有限（finite）仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得对每个<MATH_0006>，存在有限（finite）分解（decomposition）<MATH_0007>，其各项为局部闭（locally closed）的可构造（constructible）子集（subsets），使得<MATH_0008>有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant）。由拓扑（Topology），引理<REF_0001>，每个<MATH_0009>都可构造（constructible），作为子集（subset），属于<MATH_0010>。由拓扑（Topology），引理<REF_0002>，可以找到有限（finite）分层（stratification）<MATH_0011>，其各层（strata）可构造（constructible）且局部闭（locally closed），使得每个<MATH_0012>都是并（union），由<MATH_0013>组成。因此(3)成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n假设(3)成立。设<MATH_0014>为仿射开集（affine open）。则<MATH_0015>为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子集（closed subset），属于<MATH_0016>（例如由性质（Properties），引理<REF_0003>），且<MATH_0017>为划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0018>，如定义<REF_0004>中所述。因此(1)成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"stratification","target_term":"分层"},{"source_term":"strata","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"union","target_term":"并"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"局部闭子集"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"stratification","target_term":"分层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"strata","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"union","target_term":"并","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"局部闭子集","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
